OL,3,ATributes paid to 'deeply caring' dad
OL,4,Akilled in Swiss Alps plane crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavies was killed when the Cirrus SR22T
OL,7,Fcrashed high in the mountains near the
OL,8,Ftown of Leukerbad in the southern
OL,9,Fcanton of Valais on Tuesday.
